        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-859, Lined Rod with Petals at End</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rustic Ridged Cabinet Pull really catches the highlights of the 7 available finishes. A simple pull, it has subtle petal shapes at the ends. Made by RK International, the Lined Rod with Petals at End is available with 3 inch, 5 inch, and 8 inch center to centers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/rustic-ridged-door-pull-rk-international-ph-4861\"><b>Rustic Ridged Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-859 Ridged Rod Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-859</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>CP-860</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>CP-861</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
